%!PS
% Source for receipt.pdf, a small test receipt. Rebuild with:
%   ps2pdf -sPAPERSIZE=a4 tests/fixtures/receipt.ps tests/fixtures/receipt.pdf

/center { /y exch def /s exch def s stringwidth pop 595 exch sub 2 div y moveto s show } def  % (text) y center
/right { /y exch def /s exch def 523 s stringwidth pop sub y moveto s show } def             % (text) y right

/Helvetica-Bold findfont 24 scalefont setfont
(CORNER CAFE) 760 center

/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont setfont
(123 Main Street) 735 center

72 690 moveto (Latte ........................................ $4.50) show
72 674 moveto (Croissant .................................... $3.25) show
72 658 moveto (------------------------------------------------------------) show

/Helvetica-Bold findfont 12 scalefont setfont
72 642 moveto (Total) show
($7.75) 642 right

/Symbol findfont 12 scalefont setfont
72 610 moveto <b7> show
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont setfont
86 610 moveto (Free refills on drip coffee) show

72 580 moveto (Thank you for visiting. This paragraph is long enough that it wraps across) show
72 566 moveto (more than one line on the page, so the filter should rejoin it into one) show
72 552 moveto (paragraph and rewrap it to the receipt width.) show

(1) 40 center
showpage
